<main class="setup-page"><h1>Privacy policy</h1><p class="help">TTRPG Card Generator by bankenichi · Updated November 10, 2026</p>
<section class="panel setup-panel">
<p>We do not collect, sell, or track your data. There are no accounts, ads, or tracking tools.</p>
<p>Your cards, files, and settings are used on your device. The included SRD library works offline.</p>
<p>If you download from GitHub or another site, that site sees your internet address and the link you request. The same happens when you open a web link. That site's privacy rules apply.</p>
<p>You choose which files to open and where to save or share your cards.</p>
<p>Your data stays until you remove it. On Android, clear the app's storage or uninstall it. On desktop, delete the app folder. Delete saved exports and device backups separately.</p>
<p>Questions? <a href="https://github.com/bankenichi/TTRPG-Card-Generator/issues">Contact bankenichi on GitHub</a>. Please do not post private files there.</p>
